heretic-ascension-ash_final = { $spooky_start } Fear the blaze, for the Ashlord, { $player } has ascended! The flames shall consume all! { $spooky_end }

heretic-ascension-blade_final = { $spooky_start } Master of blades, the Torn Champion's disciple, { $player } has ascended! Their steel is that which will cut reality in a maelstrom of silver! { $spooky_end }

heretic-ascension-cosmic_final = { $spooky_start } A Star Gazer has arrived into the station, { $player } has ascended! This station is the domain of the Cosmos! { $spooky_end }

heretic-ascension-flesh_final = { $spooky_start } Ever coiling vortex. Reality unfolded. ARMS OUTREACHED, THE LORD OF THE NIGHT, { $player } has ascended! Fear the ever twisting hand! { $spooky_end }

heretic-ascension-lock_final = Delta-class dimensional anomaly detec{ $spooky_start } Reality rended, torn. Gates open, doors open, { $player } has ascended! Fear the tide! { $spooky_end }

heretic-ascension-moon_final = { $spooky_start } Laugh, for the ringleader { $player } has ascended! The truth shall finally devour the lie! { $spooky_end }

heretic-ascension-rust_final = { $spooky_start } Fear the decay, for the Rustbringer, { $player } has ascended! None shall escape the corrosion! { $spooky_end }

heretic-ascension-void_final = { $spooky_start } The nobleman of void { $player } has arrived, stepping along the Waltz that ends worlds! { $spooky_end }

